---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section>
  <SectionHeader cmd="cat about.md" />

  <div class="prose-term text-fg/85 leading-relaxed max-w-[64ch]">
    <p>
      I write Go, Rust and TypeScript for a living, and a bit of everything else for fun.
      I&apos;ve spent the last few years maintaining
      <a class="link-inline" href="https://github.com/alist-org/alist" target="_blank" rel="noopener">alist</a>
      &mdash; a multi-cloud file list tool used by hundreds of thousands &mdash; and
      a long tail of small libraries, CLIs and editor extensions.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3">
      I&apos;m most interested in developer tools, distributed systems, and interfaces that
      <span class="text-fg">respect their users&apos; time</span>. I believe the best
      software is the kind you stop noticing.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .prose-term {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
